{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "48fdedc629f7bd86d9927eb48988499c81c6bf24926603fbda5d072fbcd70197", "ja": "ステキにストイック", "zh": "帅气又克己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6bc9a721a5a61fead2470666fb0c762a0818a74f50296e0f09db2084250ca8d2", "ja": "原宿でのロケを終えた伊織、やよい、桃子。\nそのままの流れで、買い物でのいい子対決と\nなる。個性を活かした品物選びでポイントを\nゲットするやよいと桃子だが、伊織は自分は\n二人に及んでいないからと辞退する。", "zh": "结束原宿外景拍摄的伊织、弥生和桃子。\n三人顺势展开了购物时的乖孩子对决。\n弥生和桃子发挥各自的个性挑选商品，赢得了分数，\n而伊织却说自己比不上她们两人，主动退出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95fce7f2ef25f060bd3a41feaf629023470bb34324e0112328602786ceeba188", "ja": "（今日の皆は、原宿の流行を紹介する番組に出演中！\nグルメやファッション、色々なものに触れて……）", "zh": "（今天大家正在参加一档介绍原宿潮流的节目！接触了美食、时尚等各种各样的事物……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "42ee8dfc3743f7b579b2573fdc5b7e5e5f945b2e465c6bbec8de77866c082bc4", "ja": "みんなお疲れ様！　それぞれコメントも見事だったし、\nお店の方も喜んでくれて……文句なしだよ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！每个人的点评都很精彩，店家也很开心……无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7f6e137afbdc8eb54ffd80279282007aacdc3163990b2227430dd518824aeb4", "ja": "ふふん♪　桃子はプロとして、\nトーゼンの仕事をしただけだよ。", "zh": "哼哼♪桃子只是作为专业人士，做了理所当然的工作而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "4567ea94dd4ac10433f5a478ae69b46c8c32899298ed1cc5e2abbd485a6c1952", "ja": "めずらしいスイーツがいろいろ食べられて、\nとーっても楽しいお仕事でした！", "zh": "吃到了好多少见的甜点，\n是一份非——常开心的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "47913c3ba3808c4268210cf151217d4b3ce4f3b9379fc54e85e924c12f250a96", "ja": "撮影も終わったし……ここから、例の企画を\n始めるっていうのもアリなわけよね？", "zh": "拍摄也结束了……接下来开始那个企划，也不是不可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1978fc56e0ea4e666a452651601f3ebdd4e358fef3996f8d57b1c7cb19bdc1a4", "ja": "ああ、『いい子ポイント』を集める対決だな。\nデジカメは持ち歩いてるから、撮影可能だ。", "zh": "啊，就是收集“好孩子点数”的对决吧。\n我随身带着数码相机，可以拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "d30bc893740c30873cc212384ec4fadbd76dc39e1432b6a78f5d462c7e1afd02", "ja": "せっかく原宿に来てるんですもの。\nお買い物勝負するのは、どうかしら？", "zh": "难得来到原宿。\n要不要来比比谁买得更好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "bf10cd03a18d2d57d0b7e9275f64aaf1c806be9cda66fd9b6dec298f34ead4ce", "ja": "『いい子』がテーマのファッションよ。\nもちろん、予算は決めてね！", "zh": "主题是“乖孩子”风格的时装。\n当然，要先定好预算哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e126b3ee16cb56a458eda4fffc355c5143b3c071cd306f6acacd47dd6c6a16ee", "ja": "原宿でお買い物勝負……\nなるほど、個性が出て面白いかもしれないな。", "zh": "在原宿比拼购物……\n原来如此，这样或许能展现个性，挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e2de4b2a376e56f07385f389cead3d2a71194ef0a5d7a6ace41748fe63554c2b", "ja": "でも仕事の後なのにいいのか？", "zh": "不过明明是在工作之后，这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "70a4a0c5d61bf801a60c3e771f20765d22fd0551663daee5fd5eedafe7591005", "ja": "桃子はいいと思う。だって、\nお仕事で原宿を歩いたばっかりでしょ？", "zh": "桃子觉得没关系。因为，你刚才不是才因工作在原宿逛过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "e02f13bd7279c9c9c79b32217da9a3b51a19b15cadef1e41573064bf57e4eec3", "ja": "お店の情報がある状態だもん。\nフェアな勝負ができると思うよ。", "zh": "毕竟手上有店铺的信息嘛。\n我觉得这样就能进行公平的较量了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "ee4e6b07dc776b8767807c467476c8e7f6b9940ecef746c7bd0bb84641d16094", "ja": "その通りよ。\n桃子は察しがいいわね♪", "zh": "没错。桃子很会察言观色嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "e5769d462c228fd845c98f1391b9163c958e7628d127761f0721f4be90d385b1", "ja": "下見は済んでいるようなものだし。\n何を買ってくるか……そこで競いましょ！", "zh": "就当已经提前踩过点了。\n至于要买什么回来……我们就比比这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "318a29f7fa27c3ca47b376bbc7be567dccf15c59e609cde7cbedc02dee709296", "ja": "私、お買い物ならちょっとは自信あるかも……！\n賛成ですー！", "zh": "说到买东西，我还是有点自信的……！\n赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a8e0e48cb843a5ca384581a2c46d838930958df9c0eb76a29b285d59d6c9bcc2", "ja": "そういうことなら……じゃあ、それぞれ\n買い物をしてきて、劇場で発表しよう！", "zh": "既然这样……那就各自去买东西，然后回剧场展示吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1016_null", "source_sha256": "b5eb768dcc646061421bd5ff4744d0a7973b95a19bb3f781452c781c2519d488", "ja": "買い物終了後……", "zh": "买完东西后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "5a6a5c29bca96b1bfe0dbefac30c5d5c7035442ed8f1fff6470ff0f2794a34d7", "ja": "私が買ったのは、ヘアアクセサリー、です！\n髪留めと、ゆるキャラのヘアピンと……。", "zh": "我买的是发饰！\n发夹，还有卡通造型的发卡……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b7df2a45ec4332806469c2b70c0506eb650d009c45342748b22114eb0b8c32e3", "ja": "服じゃなくてアクセサリーなんだな。\n金額の上限より、だいぶ安く収まってるけど……。", "zh": "原来买的是配饰，不是衣服啊。\n比预算上限便宜了不少……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "d226f970fa42156b247b831af16de43049d521e0988d7c219c41c1f00370fe26", "ja": "予算は聞いてましたけど、これがいいなって。\n髪って、ちょっといじるだけで変わりますし！", "zh": "我听说过预算，不过我觉得这个挺好的。头发只要稍微弄一弄，就会有变化嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "c53134eefb64bc751f8e8cddc841afb80189327837c2759b5c9b4b0d4d13b147", "ja": "そうだね。ピンを増やしたり前髪いじったり、\n鏡の前でやるのは楽しいかも。", "zh": "是啊。多别几枚发夹，摆弄一下刘海，  \n在镜子前这样做或许也挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "7928fcbf2789ee96d74983bbdbb4a3efb39ab7bb1035e631301966276797860b", "ja": "そうなんだー。こんな小さなもので、オシャレが\nたっくさん味わえるのは、お得だなーって！", "zh": "原来是这样——用这么小的东西，就能享受到好多时尚乐趣，感觉真划算呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "eb907c6fc6607d9863a170be87cb1557f99f379cd0c37476ab1c7b9fa6101150", "ja": "なるほど。安価なもので最大限にオシャレを\n楽しむ……いい子ポイント、贈呈だな！", "zh": "原来如此。用便宜的东西最大限度地享受时尚……这值得奖励一个“好孩子积分”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "1856773caa862ae757d3b5875e1d830523831fe7e69a6a68bea9933d25b1e3cd", "ja": "うっうー！\n『いい子ポイント』、ゲットしましたー！", "zh": "呜呜——！\n我拿到“好孩子积分”啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "2f509fef64a469ce8a03b9e22a675dd3c15ddc34c8fd88e821e830346f0c2be7", "ja": "それじゃあ、次は桃子だね！\n桃子は、ワンピースを買ってきたよ。", "zh": "那么，接下来轮到桃子了！\n桃子买了一条连衣裙回来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "a453fe85479d815e7f01355944f4740bfc3511219152f5f91a5dc9889974837c", "ja": "ちょっとレトロで、可愛いでしょ。しかも、すごく\n安いんだよ。桃子のお小遣いで買えるんだから！", "zh": "有点复古，很可爱吧。而且还特别便宜，用桃子的零花钱就能买下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7d8721892696f916584d96c37f82487b292664d0cb51a93609073a489f6a7ee9", "ja": "おお、紺色のドット柄ワンピースか。\n……なるほど、古着のリメイクなんだな。", "zh": "哦，是藏青色波点连衣裙啊。\n……原来如此，是用旧衣服改造的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "6f37f9f11efc28ca657504898d5d62e240ce8ce415eadc316903e82470df54d9", "ja": "わあ、とっても可愛い！\nいいお買い物したね、桃子！", "zh": "哇，太可爱了！\n买到了很棒的东西呢，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "e632b8c5e2a5e048a7e6cba1683cac9160a10fc4ac6c85957ae2a39ffb7c0918", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとう、やよいさん♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你，弥生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "3232b3172771b03d984be65e4aeee89b816be425a1a49af438a684a633af4e33", "ja": "あれ？　でも、古着のブランドなんて、\n今日の仕事で紹介したっけ？", "zh": "咦？不过，今天的工作里\n有介绍过古着的品牌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "117da7696de300fc4a5cb4f1c92bb49f959b437017c02e1baffb170d5a0057a7", "ja": "あ、番組では紹介できなかったけど、\n候補の中にあったお店なの。", "zh": "啊，虽然没能在节目中介绍，但这家店也在候选名单里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "fb4cb1b66cae97730854df6a4ebcfa788a014be77d6ffa086fb7b400123f649e", "ja": "桃子、番組の資料をもらった時から、\nこのお店が気になってたんだ。", "zh": "桃子从拿到节目的资料时起，就一直很在意这家店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "1eede697c82a672e5098ea844f0b70651f7e3f4f47d0df2d915865f0df3661b3", "ja": "隅々まで資料を読み込んでいるからこそ、\n気付けたんだな……桃子ならではだ。", "zh": "正因为把资料读到了每个角落，才能注意到啊……这就是桃子独有的细心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a684db7a50b1430927d0762d6572b489334fd6346e6062e9b60dca4b1ceb1e98", "ja": "仕事にしっかり備えているいい子だな！\n桃子にも『いい子ポイント』をあげよう！", "zh": "是个为工作认真做好准备的好孩子啊！\n也给桃子发一个“好孩子积分”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "bff4bef4dde04cf5b51a2ef5d503f66a006c53459f1a759971766d098c18d07b", "ja": "ありがと、お兄ちゃん。まあ、桃子は\n普通にしてるだけでもいい子だけどね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，大哥哥。不过，桃子就算\n只是和平常一样，也是个乖孩子就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "6ced0a2a76627de18fef67c0f69d592957f1d84fc55118640b14dd24ec66cb97", "ja": "伊織ちゃんは……わぁ、素敵なカーディガン！\n持ってるお洋服とも、組み合わせしやすそう！", "zh": "伊织……哇，好漂亮的开衫！感觉也很容易和你现有的衣服搭配呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "2445ac916e014a8ec4c6f02f6642e956b717ac09c6b29f1a4e99162b5230c9ee", "ja": "うん。エレガントさもあるんだけど、\n着回ししやすそうで、さすがだなって思ったよ。", "zh": "嗯。既有高雅的气质，\n而且看起来又很百搭，真不愧是她呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "02d2b695e1e0e99f3345b5ee3e5b14586a207ce94f49efa61d0696a9450c4a25", "ja": "なるほどな。伊織はファッションセンスの\nいい子ということで……。", "zh": "原来如此。伊织是个很有时尚品味的女孩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "72e5d02de332702fdb62f2bad03ded7439d317e60162844bf4e8db52565a335e", "ja": "ちょっと。カメラ止めなさい。", "zh": "等等，把摄像机停下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "19d3295a6622779301bcf921db6c4aaa3e384e19ec5c1fc7312168bdbaecd997", "ja": "今日の勝負は、2人の勝ちよ。\nこれで、ポイントをもらうわけにはいかないわ。", "zh": "今天的胜负，是2人的胜利哦。\n这样一来，我可不能拿这些点数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1042_005yay", "source_sha256": "94a3f835f5c7ce00bb3070fb465d78d895d4bdb16cd24cc1e063525b86398c9d", "ja": "そ、そうかな……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1043_007ior", "source_sha256": "01512c4f2333b1e45ed9f8408afedef23ae0f9907342985e82586ef317cb7201", "ja": "そうよ。やよいも桃子も、自分らしい視点で\n買い物をして、ポイントをもらってるもの。", "zh": "没错。弥生和桃子也都是从自己的角度出发购物，拿到积分的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "5515668994002d35366ed25b3d0f27938ca1875cd98ea961043171208c0023c5", "ja": "私はただ、センスのいい洋服選びをしただけ。\nこれでポイントをもらうのは、ちょっと違うと思うわ。", "zh": "我只是挑了些有品位的衣服而已。\n要因为这个拿到积分，我觉得有点不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfa37aaf38448d32ea5422635c69b3500f3600844be13d4198f59f8af2bcd087", "ja": "伊織さん……。", "zh": "伊织……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "afb13c03daf969d053a94ef42ef0944bea808350d1ed59ea04e0810d4d855066", "ja": "厳しい自己判定だな……。採点基準は、\nそこまで厳しくなくていいと思うんだけど。", "zh": "这自我评价也太严格了吧……我觉得评分标准没必要定得那么严。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1047_007ior", "source_sha256": "07df5cd084cc726fc7585753ff658aadebd41f9c077d07e088181decfb1368d6", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんにお情けをくれるっていうの？\nアンタも大した立場になったもんね。", "zh": "你这是要对本小姐心慈手软吗？你还真是摆起架子来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6c21bc8fca40d6b59c4de9eef6fa0f46554c4ed9757645c655e291456c881488", "ja": "いや、そういうわけじゃ……。", "zh": "不，我不是那个意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "66de5db8694ea82e804c42d2360975fcb8d7a312f8da96b82601fefd1a37d58a", "ja": "やよい、桃子。あんた達の買い物は見事よ。\nポイントはしっかりもらっときなさい。", "zh": "弥生、桃子。你们买得很漂亮嘛。\n积分可要好好拿到手哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "8fd7ff941f206421023d24918c874024412eced738512027c55fcd58ec8e45ae", "ja": "う、うん。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1051_005yay", "source_sha256": "411c3b0c3f6fa96f74e80fc1201aba1129bafc4c4cee8a78753055b417580203", "ja": "いいの？　私は伊織ちゃんのお買い物も\nとっても素敵だと思ったけど……。", "zh": "这样好吗？我觉得伊织买的东西\n其实也非常棒呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1052_007ior", "source_sha256": "81bb451aab91e03c60e70f17b7a9f4db1bc7884fa3560438d6b2d0cf3ea04e05", "ja": "ありがとう、やよい。でもこれは、みんなとの\n勝負だから。納得いく形で競い合いたいのよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，弥生。但这是和大家的\n比赛。我想在自己心服口服的前提下一较高下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1053_007ior", "source_sha256": "89c9dba0955e6892ce7202b500fa2c2d3d7d2658ec5ac3f3f5a80a4030633a61", "ja": "それに、勝負は始まったばかりでしょ？\nここから追い上げていけば問題はないわ！", "zh": "而且比赛才刚刚开始吧？\n从现在开始奋起直追就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "0d48633c09cb4dc3515460f6a4601b4bc08a100bd599829f05736ee201f56076", "ja": "（仲間との本気の勝負となればこそ、か……。\nみんなの真剣勝負、ますます目が離せないな！）", "zh": "（正因为是和同伴认真较量，才会这样吗……。\n大家的全力对决，真是越来越让人移不开视线了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
